{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿宣佈對以色列的懲罰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要歡喜快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要像外族人那樣歡喜快樂！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你對你的上帝不忠不貞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喜愛在各麥場上接受嫖資。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"麥場上的穀物和榨酒池的酒將不夠養活你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新酒也必斷絕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們將不能再住在耶和華的土地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮要返回埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在亞述吃不潔之物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們將不能再獻奠祭給耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的祭牲也不蒙悅納。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些祭物如居喪之人的食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃的人都被玷污。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的食物只能供自己吃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能帶進耶和華的殿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在節日，在耶和華所定的節期裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要做什麼呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你們逃脫毀滅之災，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人也要把你們聚集起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在摩弗埋葬你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的珍貴銀器要散落在荊棘中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的帳篷中要長滿蒺藜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人受懲罰的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭報應的時候到了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必知道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們罪惡深重，充滿憎恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知被當成傻瓜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被靈感動的人被視為瘋子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知為了上帝做以法蓮的守望者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是他走的路上佈滿網羅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他上帝的家裡遭人憎恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們敗壞至極，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恰如從前在基比亞的日子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必記住你們的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追討你們的罪債。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「昔日我看見以色列時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在荒野看見葡萄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看見你們的祖先時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在無花果樹上看見初熟的果子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他們卻祭拜巴力·毗珥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把自己獻給可恥的偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"變得像他們所愛的偶像一樣可憎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮人的榮耀要如鳥飛逝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們將不能受孕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能懷胎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能生育。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們縱然把孩子養大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要奪去他們的性命，一個也不留。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我撇棄你們的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們就有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看見以法蓮栽種在草原上，美如泰爾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮卻要把兒女交給屠殺者。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你給他們——","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要給他們什麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你使他們子宮流產，乳房乾癟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「因他們在吉甲的一切惡行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已憎惡他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他們的惡行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要將他們逐出我的家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再愛他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的首領都是悖逆之人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮要被擊打，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的根將枯乾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不能結果。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就算他們能生兒育女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要殺死他們心愛的孩子。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"我的上帝必棄絕他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們不聽從祂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必在列國中流離飄泊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}